<title>USA: Syms Corp plans to open 19 stores by 2001.</title>
<headline>Syms Corp plans to open 19 stores by 2001.</headline>
<dateline>SECAUCUS, N.J. 1997-04-21</dateline>
<text>
<p>Syms Corp said Monday it plans to open 19 new stores by the end of 2001 as part of a five-year expansion plan.</p>
<p>The company said in a statement that it would only open those stores if the real estate market remained conducive and as long as it could pay for the stores &quot;primarily through internally generated dollars.&quot;</p>
<p>Syms currently operates 40 off-price apparel stores in 16 states.</p>
